---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ChartGallery from '../components/ChartGallery.astro';
import BrandEvidence from '../components/BrandEvidence.astro';
import {evidenceRecords,summaryCharts} from '../data/evidence';
const extra=evidenceRecords.find(r=>!r.brandSlug)!;
---
<Base title="品牌测速与流媒体解锁图表｜29 组高清资料" description="收录维护者提供的 29 组品牌节点测速、流媒体与 AI 状态图，附高清原图、场景时间和指标说明。28 组对应现有品牌档案，额外收录浪网 WaveNet 图表。" breadcrumbs={[{name:'测速图表',url:'/evidence/'}]}>
 <header class="evidence-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="light-dot"></span> THE CHART ARCHIVE</p><h1>每一组数据，<br/><em>都有图可查。</em></h1><p>从品牌找到节点，从摘要读到原图。<br/>测速、流媒体与 AI 状态，在这里一起查看。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#brand-charts">查找品牌图表 ↓</a><a class="quiet-button" href="#chart-summaries">查看两张汇总图 ↗</a></div></div><div class="evidence-hero-stat"><span>ARCHIVE / OCT 2026</span><strong>29<span>组品牌图表</span></strong><div><span>58 张品牌图</span><span>2 张汇总图</span></div><p>维护者提供 · 高清原图保留</p><div class="evidence-signal" aria-hidden="true">{[24,43,32,67,50,82,63,96,75,60,86,70,100,79,68,89,62,80].map(height=><i style={'height:'+height+'%'}></i>)}</div></div></header>
 <div class="evidence-source-note"><span class="tag neutral">来源说明</span><p>图表场景为 2026-10-01 至 2026-10-21，时区未注明；2026-10-23 收录。维护者提供，本站未独立复测。本地运营商、设备、带宽及原始日志未提供，展示顺序沿用资料顺序。</p><a href="/review/">了解评测方法 ↗</a></div>
 <section class="evidence-index" aria-labelledby="brand-charts"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR BRAND</p><h2 id="brand-charts">找到品牌，直达图表。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/airport/">品牌套餐与优惠 ↗</a></div><label for="evidence-search">搜索品牌名称</label><input type="search" id="evidence-search" class="search-input" placeholder="输入隐形人、Breezenet、飞猫…"/><p class="fine-print" id="evidence-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">共 29 组 · 图示平均下载，单位 MB/s；非速度排名。</p><div class="evidence-brand-grid">{evidenceRecords.map((r,i)=><article id={r.brandSlug?r.slug:undefined} class="evidence-brand-card" data-evidence-search={r.name.toLowerCase()}><div><span class="evidence-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="tag neutral">{r.brandSlug?'品牌档案已关联':'额外图表资料'}</span></div><h3><a href={r.brandSlug?'/airport/'+r.brandSlug+'/#performance-evidence':'#wavenet'}>{r.name}</a></h3><p>图示平均下载 <strong>{r.averageDownloadMBps.toFixed(2)} <small>MB/s</small></strong></p><time>{r.time.slice(0,10)}</time><a class="evidence-card-link" href={r.brandSlug?'/airport/'+r.brandSlug+'/#performance-evidence':'#wavenet'}>查看测速与解锁图 <span>↗</span></a></article>)}</div><noscript><p class="fine-print">所有品牌已在本页列出；可使用浏览器查找定位名称。</p></noscript></section>
 <section class="evidence-summary" aria-labelledby="chart-summaries"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE COMPLETE PICTURE</p><h2 id="chart-summaries">两张汇总图，先看全貌。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="#reading-the-charts">指标怎样读 ↓</a></div><p>汇总与各品牌长图配套阅读。测速汇总采用隐形人 IEPL 修订版；其余品牌保留提供图中的名称与数值。不同品牌测试时间不同，不能据此作同条件竞速结论。</p><ChartGallery name="全部品牌" speed={summaryCharts.speed} unlock={summaryCharts.unlock} summary/></section>
 <section id="wavenet" class="evidence-extra"><p class="fine-print">额外收录：这组资料暂未对应本站现有品牌档案，未提供套餐、价格或推广入口。</p><BrandEvidence record={extra} headingId="wavenet-charts" hub/></section>
 <section class="evidence-method" aria-labelledby="reading-the-charts"><p class="eyebrow">READ THE SIGNALS</p><h2 id="reading-the-charts">看懂数字，再作判断。</h2><div><article><h3>01 / 速度与延迟</h3><p>下载速度保留原图 MB/s 单位，平均为节点等权均值，最高为所有节点峰值中的最大值。TLS RTT 与 HTTPS Ping 分开记录，峰值不代表持续吞吐。</p></article><article><h3>02 / 平台状态</h3><p>解锁汇总中的 n/60 是绿色状态节点数，不是独立请求成功率。黄色、灰色与红色分别阅读；Steam 为货币区显示数，不作解锁率。</p></article><article><h3>03 / 使用与稳定性</h3><p>结果只对应图示时点和节点。你的设备、运营商、时段与目标服务可能不同；平台可访问不等于账号使用资格，长期稳定性需要连续记录。</p></article></div><div class="inline-reading"><a href="/guides/run-controlled-node-test/">同条件节点测试教程 →</a><a href="/blog/stability-method/">长期稳定性记录方法 →</a><a href="/contact/">图表纠错与补充 →</a></div></section>
 <div class="reading-utility"><a href="/airport/">返回品牌资料库 →</a><a href="#main">返回顶部 ↑</a></div>
 <script>const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#evidence-search')!;const cards=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-evidence-search]')];input.addEventListener('input',()=>{let count=0;const query=input.value.trim().toLowerCase();cards.forEach(card=>{card.hidden=!card.dataset.evidenceSearch!.includes(query);if(!card.hidden)count++;});document.querySelector('#evidence-count')!.textContent=count?`显示 ${count} 组 · 图示平均下载，单位 MB/s；非速度排名。`:'未找到匹配品牌，试试更短的名称。';});</script>
</Base>
